    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Blast\" title=\"Force Blast\">Force Blast</a></i> Force Power, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to compare the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of all other characters, creatures, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a> within 2 squares of your target. If you exceed the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of those secondary targets, they also take damage from the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Blast\" title=\"Force Blast\">Force Blast</a></i>, and if you fail to exceed their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, they take half damage instead.<br><br>This is considered to be an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> against the secondary targets (but not against the original target).",
